# What this spoon needs from outside Hammerspoon.
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason. See Olm's lib/deps.lua.
# Optional rather than required, even though the sampler cannot be built without it,
# because the spoon already answers a failed build with an alert and a console line and
# the key stays discoverable. Required is reserved for a spoon the root should refuse to
# wire at all, where a present but dead binding would be the worse outcome.
swiftc | system | /usr/bin/swiftc | optional | compiles the native colour sampler helper
